        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions PR-DLG150SMTS4, Delong 1-1/2 Inch Stainless Steel Back to Back Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Back-to-Back Stainless Steel Delong Pull is made in the USA by First Impressions--a leader in custom door hardware. This 1-1/2 Inch Stainless Steel Delong Back-to-Back Pull Set comes packaged with everything you need to install it on a door made of wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal including 2 pulls (one for the exterior and one for the interior) and lock-down rosettes (not pictured). This modern door pull is available in 18 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. The grip is made out of stainless steel and the hourglass-shaped mounts are made out of brass, allowing the possibility to mix and match finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with Back to Back mounting (2 door pulls bolted to each other - 1 door pull for each side of a door). Includes lock down threaded rosettes to securely tighten the door pulls to the door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions 1-1/2\" Delong Door Pull Pair:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DLG02-specifications.pdf?v=1704262300\"><b>First Impressions PR-DLG150SMTS4 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>PR-DLG150018SMTS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Bracket Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.63\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>PR-DLG150024SMTS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Bracket Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.63\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>PR-DLG150036SMTS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Bracket Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance:1.63\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This First Impressions door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including different center to center mounting distances and  <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting</b>.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "1-1/2 Inch Diameter Door Pull Pair",
                "description": "This 1-1/2 Inch Stainless Steel Delong Back-to-Back Pull Set comes packaged with everything you need to install it on a door made of wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal. This modern door pull is available in 18 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. The grip is made out of stainless steel and the hourglass-shaped mounts are made out of brass, allowing the possibility to mix and match finishes. \r\n",
